---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Marketing Executive VA"
  description="How this site collects, uses and protects your personal data — in plain English."
  path="/privacy"
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap legal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: 11 June 2026</p>

      <!-- [TODO-HUMAN] Replace bracketed entity details; have a qualified person
           review before launch. This is a sensible plain-English starting draft,
           not legal advice. -->

      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is operated by [LEGAL/TRADING NAME] (“I”, “me”), based in the {SITE.country}.
        Contact: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What data is collected, and why</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email and message — used solely to reply to your enquiry.</li>
        <li><strong>Resource downloads:</strong> your name and email — used to send the resource and occasional relevant emails. Every email includes an unsubscribe link.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> [ANALYTICS TODO — name the tool once chosen]. The intention is privacy-respecting, cookie-light analytics measuring aggregate page use, not individuals.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Lawful basis</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiries are processed on the basis of legitimate interest (replying to you). Marketing
        emails are sent on the basis of consent, which you can withdraw at any time via the
        unsubscribe link or by emailing {SITE.email}.
      </p>

      <h2>Sharing</h2>
      <p>
        Your data is never sold. It is shared only with the service providers needed to run this
        site and its email — [TODO-HUMAN: list ESP, form/booking provider, hosting once chosen] —
        each under their own GDPR-compliant terms.
      </p>

      <h2>Retention</h2>
      <p>
        Enquiry emails are kept as long as needed to manage the relationship. Mailing-list data is
        kept until you unsubscribe.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK GDPR you can request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data
        at any time: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. You can also complain to the
        ICO (ico.org.uk) if you believe data has been mishandled.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .legal h2 {
    margin-top: 36px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
  }
</style>
